{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16737","headline":"古挽歌 一 · 于鹄","name":"古挽歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双辙出郭门，绵绵东西道。\n送死多於生，几人得终老。\n见此切肺肝，不如归山好。\n不闻哀哭声，默默安怀抱。\n时尽从物化，又免生忧扰。\n世间寿者稀，尽爲悲伤恼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}